



Throttling :  rate limit to API 


=========================================

Default  = DEFAULT_THROTTLE_CLASSES & DEFAULT_THROTTLE_RATES are global

ex:  

REST_FRAMEWORK = {
    'DEFAULT_THROTTLE_CLASSES':[
        'rest_framework.throttling.AnonRateThrottle',
        'rest_framework.throttling.UserRateThrottle'
    ],
    'DEFAULT_THROTTLE_RATES':{
        'anon': '5/minute',
        'user': '10/minute'
    }
}


AnonRateThrottle : it's a way to limit the number of requests per minute for unauthenticated users. (unknown user)

UserRateThrottle : it's a way to limit the number of requests per minute for authenticated users. (registered user)

ScopedRateThrottle : it's a way to limit the number of requests per minute for a specific scope. (deepSearch)


